# Owning plan 04-22: cases of the in-step selftest of the gate step pkg-install (D-40). Each case
# mutates a COPY (or probes a deleted path) and must fail for its intended reason; one case name per
# line; the step runs exactly these and fails on a name it does not know (pkg-selftest-missing).
# The remaining D-40 cases (leak-detector, golden-drift) belong to the consumer (plan 04-23).
core-src-include
missing-symbol
ghost-decl
unprefixed
extra-file
baked-path
version-refused
old-prefix
